# Artisan Detail — Agent Rules

**Full spec:** [docs/artisan-detail-feature.md](../../docs/artisan-detail-feature.md)  
**Global rules:** [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md)

## Before coding

1. Read `docs/artisan-detail-feature.md` and `AGENTS.md`
2. Use typed mock data in `src/data/` — no backend
3. Single source of truth for artisan data (avoid list/detail drift)

## Screen

- Route: `src/app/artisan/[id].tsx`
- Sections: hero, about, stats, portfolio, reviews, contact, billing (optional), sticky Book Now footer
- Invalid id → not found state with back navigation

## UI

- Mature neutral styling — no per-category rainbow colors, no emoji icons
- Icons in `src/components/icons.tsx` only
- NativeWind + StyleSheet exceptions per AGENTS.md
- Dark mode required

## Navigation

- Book Now on `ArtisanCard` → `router.push(\`/artisan/${id}\`)`

## Done when

- All artisans have rich detail data
- Detail screen complete and wired from dashboard
- Lint passes
